@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR002: Manage Notification Preferences" as SAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Customize Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "CFR006: Monitor Spending Limits" as CFR006
  usecase "CFR007: View Investment Opportunities" as CFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Access Portfolio News" as CFR008
  usecase "CFR009: Manage Relationship with Advisors" as CFR009

  usecase "SFR012: Generate Client Dashboards" as SFR012
  usecase "SFR013: Send Alerts Based on Conditions" as SFR013
  usecase "AIFR001: Analyze Historical Data for Predictions" as AIFR001
  usecase "AIFR006: Detect Anomaly Transactions" as AIFR006

  CFR001 --> Client : View financial data consolidated in a dashboard.
  
  SAFR002 <|-- SysAdmin : Manage notification preferences for alerts and system parameters.

  CFR003 --> Client : Receive financial predictions based on historical data and market trends.
  SAFA004: As Financial Advisor, I want to configure analysis parameters. Not present here but inferred from requirement structure.

  SAFR005 <|-- SysAdmin : Manage spending limit alerts thresholds.

  AIFR001 --> Client : Generate financial predictions for clients.
  
  CFR007 --> Client : View investment opportunities based on risk profile and portfolio goals.
  AIFR004: As an AI system, I must generate investment opportunity analyses. Not present here but inferred from requirement structure.

  SFR008 <|-- SysAdmin : Request specific investments matching user criteria (not directly in requirements).

  CFR009 --> Client : Access a single view consolidating all financial information.
  
  AIFR006: As an AI system, I must generate anomaly transaction alerts. Not present here but inferred from requirement structure.

  SFR013 --> Client : Receive timely notifications about critical events via appropriate channels (e.g., SMS, email).
}

Client as Client
SysAdmin as SysAdmin

@enduml